&lt;p style="line-height: 1.4; margin: 12px 0 0 0; color: inherit; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px !important;"&gt;动量交易只是让投资者尝到了如果他们未能对冲或多元化的话可能会出现的明显盈亏波动的感受，而不断上升的通胀风险又强化了这一警告。 &lt;/p&gt;&lt;div style="display: block; width: 100%; height: 40px; text-align: center; line-height: 40px; border: 1px solid; border-radius: 8px; margin: 16px 0 0 0; font-size: 14px !important;"&gt;阅读更多&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="border-top: 1px solid; margin: 24px 0 0 0;"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;由于人工智能股票的抛售&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/ZJkg0PChp9er7k3OAbnaJzsc-O9rpGBM5UqRR6q8o4TmgCSX-0DH_I8s2nsm1xoQvQlznMzVdtyzIZhUutg5qKWLIWcg0AdstQzuo-ix-yavBB4mJetcIPxB1s7GY8_nJWcZHorm7bLI9StNNPyUMlop087IMSEJ5SoqhMQYRbiD0yXgLijIWAAmtt2rfry2lYdqKCLgd0wdOkgA8R8zKYmqqzK-kJXkqMHKDbiBwhJtyQsLSsR3IbpyMEW-wGNSHmLGIRTPp24UmmdW6XhZzI6FooPUe0G4JmxP6TkO4FW27nHgv0JNKBWYYeCrHud-vE48ISLyOrs0DXw-58FAb1exUkQLcjRHLW4pHXa9BlKHl-Qw3tw71HCyCIpM7AOK-S30te76kYS_axgpK2qNF7qmtVK_ZPgdj2luaW7Vl5ZbU7mYfdLQz0g1U6RbePYNSJnMscCUfMfi7ypDf04ZM33VxrxEC8B5MYuUkzQnjEfshVNPxHL4lhGN7Lxv4__07N1WapVDb13lygF2j89OYmk7DNTc/rvw4lDFk6ZZnjR1TDxEsfL25Wx0B0xE0/23" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="由于人工智能交易重挫对冲基金，Millennium 上月下跌 2%"&gt;对股票投资组合造成影响，&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;多策略对冲基金巨头 Millennium Management&lt;/strong&gt;上个月下跌 2.1%。对冲基金交易员在 7 月份努力应对人工智能和半导体股票的下跌， &lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/5_WS7aOe8Hhni6gcDcoKV5sVm01aoaWW38OBkOqqmGzkw9o5IxtYyAgmufne_0Jiple68_wSJopDo1PkfcgRDF62Gr-hzxkMpSUEcw9C-U1Whc5NpIduJZia732ElZfL6kp3Oh4vRm87eZTByYMnUW6tNaSlQIJFVC4lthvjUw7pIu_CXjHGFIxBqkyLUVtexjlfyvEUd46GKaYxOYVbxLFk07il4Ko39SzocRrMFP19Qvnn5eit5akaNbfh8zLRYrK2QX7rxWSlyUNRFc_n8cmevKPHIiLEbdleq4CGSE7pEajc6U5QH1bP7gt6mpMNlzb3drH7n071xmeMY40spfs4sl2-v8SF7JqJA3TaYavehLHl6LrVam1kpWcIpoFkz4IsD7a-gFWISzOzadv66UwYi5IHA5GfhRJqPiRRimKHdxtWAs1oo66yUYjbrQ2tKjQn1dZVKLK08mXNcS8yE1r3wbbmyH4Rf0MUXiQo5J